@startuml
!theme plain

title Auth Endpoint Sequence - POST /api/v1/auth/reset-password

autonumber

actor Client
participant AuthController
participant PasswordResetService
database UserRepository
participant AppPasswordEncoder
participant OtpService
database Redis

Client -> AuthController: POST /api/v1/auth/reset-password\nResetPasswordRequest
AuthController -> PasswordResetService: processResetPassword(request)
PasswordResetService -> UserRepository: findByEmail(email)

alt User not found
  UserRepository --> PasswordResetService: empty
  PasswordResetService --> AuthController: throw USER_NOT_FOUND
  AuthController --> Client: 404 Not Found
else User found
  UserRepository --> PasswordResetService: User
  PasswordResetService -> OtpService: verifyOtp(email, otpCode)
  OtpService -> Redis: read otp hash + attempts + expiry

  alt OTP expired or invalid or too many attempts
    OtpService --> PasswordResetService: throw OTP_* error
    PasswordResetService --> AuthController: propagate error
    AuthController --> Client: 400 or 429
  else OTP valid
    OtpService --> PasswordResetService: verified
    PasswordResetService -> AppPasswordEncoder: encode(newPassword)
    AppPasswordEncoder --> PasswordResetService: encodedPassword
    PasswordResetService -> UserRepository: save(user with encoded password)
    PasswordResetService -> OtpService: invalidateOtp(email)
    OtpService -> Redis: delete otp key
    PasswordResetService --> AuthController: return
    AuthController --> Client: 200 OK
  end
end

@enduml
